r of police, fire or ambulance units, or conclude that a call is a prank and ignore it. Callers range from desperate relatives to people just wasting your time.\n\nFree Play lets you pick a city anywhere in the world, using its real streets, addresses and emergency infrastructure, so you can run the dispatch center for your own hometown. It is a single-player management game about triage and time pressure, suited to players who like simulation and strategy built around judgment calls."}}